= University of California, Riverside School of Medicine - Prompt 04

#section_label("Prompt metadata")
- Title: Personal Challenge, Resilience, and Grit
- Limit: 250 words
- Cycle used in this repo: 2024 archive on Admit.org
- Source: https://med.admit.org/secondary-essays/university-of-california-riverside-school-of-medicine
